cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SQAC in your research or software, please cite it as below."
title: "SQAC: Symbolic Query Addressable Cartridge"
abstract: >-
  SQAC turns facts, skills, session context, agent personas, and secrets into
  portable, queryable .sqac cartridges that any LLM can search at runtime with
  exact, lexical/fuzzy, and optional semantic tiers — no retraining, no vector
  database, and no GPU required.
type: software
